Package: pimer
Title: Use the Pi Coding Agent from R
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Pi R", "Contributors", email = "9815742+kongdd@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight R6 interface to the Pi coding agent using its
    line-delimited JSON remote procedure call protocol. Supports persistent
    in-memory conversations, structured JSON extraction, coro generators for streaming,
    token accounting, and the tools and extensions configured in Pi.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    coro,
    jsonlite,
    processx,
    R6
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/kongdd/pimer
BugReports: https://github.com/kongdd/pimer/issues
